[I] FUSE driver for APFS (Apple File System)

[T] apfs-fuse is a read-only FUSE driver for Apple's APFS file system on
[T] Linux. It also supports software encrypted (FileVault) volumes, fusion
[T] drives, snapshots, sealed volumes, GPT partition tables and mounting DMG
[T] images.

[U] https://github.com/sgan81/apfs-fuse

